    {
      "locale": "en",
      "title": "3D Nameplate with Capital Letter",
      "slug": "3d-nameplate-with-capital-letter",
      "short_description": null,
      "description": "Give the nursery a personal touch that really stands out 💕 A freestanding letter with the child's name – a nice and personal gift for newborns, christening, baby showers or as a decorative decor in the nursery. Each letter is carefully designed in Sweden and manufactured in PLA bioplastic from renewable raw materials such as corn starch and sugarcane. ✨ Details: • Customizable with any name or letter • Can be decorated with little feet, stars or hearts • Do you have special requests? Feel free to send a message before ordering • Can stand nicely on a shelf or be attached to a wall or door wit"
    },
    {
      "locale": "sv",
      "title": "3D Namnskylt med Stor Bokstav",
      "slug": "3d-bokstav-med-namn",
      "short_description": "<p>En personlig fristående bokstav med namn – perfekt som present till nyfödda, dop och barnrumsinredning.</p><p>Tillverkad i Sverige</p><p><strong>Material:</strong> <em>PLA</em> – miljövänligt och hållbart val</p><p><strong>Längd</strong>: 15–20 cm beroende på antal bokstäver <strong>Höjd</strong>: 15–20 cm</p>",
      "description": "<p><strong>Ge barnrummet en personlig detalj som verkligen sticker ut 💕</strong></p>"
    }
